## Bundled runtime (Docker image)

The container image this repository builds bundles a built DeepSeek Harness
checkout (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek) alongside the plugin group
(Apache-2.0). Both licenses are permissive, and the image carries the license and
notice files for both sides — `/app/{LICENSE,NOTICE,THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md}` and
`/deepseek-harness/{LICENSE,THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md}` — asserted by
`scripts/docker-check.sh`, so a redistributed image can never silently drop them.

